      "name": "Righteous Clamor",
      "actions": 1,
      "category": "offensive",
      "traits": [
        "holy",
        "magical"
      ],
      "text": "1 to 3\n\nFrequency once per round\n\n---\nEffect With sonorous shouts, the angelic chorus lashes out with their fists in a coordinated melee attack against each enemy in a 5-foot emanation (DC 29 basic Reflex save save). The damage depends on the number of actions\n\n1 1d8 bludgeoning damage plus 1d6 sonic damage\n\n2 2d8+7 bludgeoning damage plus 2d6 sonic damage\n\n3 3d8+10 bludgeoning damage plus 2d6 sonic damage",
      "frequency": {
        "max": 1,
        "per": "round"
      }
